# cards/todo/<set>/ is EMPTY ON PURPOSE and must stay in the tree.
#
# The pool is complete but for a handful of cards, and tests/cards/
# test_pool_wave73.gd asserts that these eight directories EXIST and are
# empty — the shape that says "nothing is owed for this set". Git does not
# carry an empty directory, so without this file a fresh clone or a git
# worktree has no cards/todo at all and that test fails on a checkout that
# is otherwise perfect. It cost two agents an hour on 2026-09-09.
